@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Waiting

state Waiting <<initial>>
Waiting : entry / new sale starts

state EnteringItems
EnteringItems : entry / customer begins selecting items
EnteringItems : do / items added one by one

state Payment
Payment : entry / all items added
Payment : do / select payment method

state VerifyingPayment
VerifyingPayment : entry / card or check chosen
VerifyingPayment : do / verify payment details

state SaleCompleted <<final>>
SaleCompleted : exit / sale finished

Waiting --> EnteringItems : new sale starts

EnteringItems --> Payment : all items added

Payment --> SaleCompleted : cash paid
Payment --> VerifyingPayment : card or check chosen

VerifyingPayment --> SaleCompleted : payment approved

SaleCompleted --> [*] : next customer

@enduml
